# OpenHands dedicated rootless Docker daemon — daemon-only environment
#
# STATUS: EXAMPLE ONLY. Copy to $OPENHANDS_HOME/docker/daemon.env on the host
# at install time if path overrides are needed. Mode 0600. Never commit a
# filled copy with host-specific secrets (this file must never contain secrets).
#
# Separation of concerns:
#   - THIS FILE (daemon-only): non-secret path overrides for dockerd-rootless
#   - ops/openhands/.env (application): LLM / GitHub / OpenHands app config
#     — loaded ONLY by corpflowai-openhands.service, NEVER by dockerd
#   - Approved secret store: actual API keys / tokens (never in git, never in
#     the dockerd unit, never pasted into chat/issues/PRs)
#
# FORBIDDEN in this file (deterministic tests enforce absence from the unit
# and from this example):
#   LLM_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN,
#   POSTGRES_URL, DATABASE_URL, MASTER_ADMIN_KEY, OAuth tokens, client creds

# Optional overrides (defaults already set via Environment= %h in the unit):
# OPENHANDS_HOME=%h/corpflowai-openhands
# DOCKER_HOST=unix://%h/corpflowai-openhands/docker/docker.sock

# Intentionally empty of assignments by default — unit Environment= lines suffice.
